{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-cloud-tower","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"cloud-tower-tiger-group-jvt","about":"Cloud Tower - a modern project by developer Tiger Group, located in the JVT neighbourhood. The complex consists of two towers of 29 floors and offers studios and apartments with 1-3 bedrooms. The interiors of the complex are made in a modern style with the use of high-quality finishing materials and stylish furniture, thanks to which each residence has a cosy and peaceful atmosphere.The residents of the complex are presented with many world-class amenities, including a gym with the most modern equipment, swimming pool with sun loungers, children's play areas, as well as areas for various sports. There is ample on-site car parking, 24-hour security with CCTV and various retail outlets are located on the ground floor of the building.The JVT area is located at the intersection of Al Khail Road and Sheikh Zayed Road, providing residents with quick access to key locations in Dubai. Schools, kindergartens, medical centres, shops, cafes and restaurants are all located within the neighbourhood. It takes about 15 minutes to reach Me'aisem City Centre, Mall of the Emirates, JBR Beach and the famous Dubai Miracle Garden and Dubai Butterfly Garden parks. Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are approximately 25 minutes' drive away.","price":1018500,"title":"Cloud Tower","bitrix":{"id":476,"pf_id":"are.2.11784","source":null,"project_id":"Cloud Tower","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Tiger Group Projects","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Tiger Group","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Triangle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/134/images/2023/6/13/340x252/qqockoNfqj9lkgiFMTQqUlodSctodksSxdemefpK.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/134/images/2023/6/13/464x312/qqockoNfqj9lkgiFMTQqUlodSctodksSxdem